                                        "entry_id": "67cadc6e-9d05-321f-9a56-8680e11f6dfe",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Any carnivorous mammal of the diverse weasel family Mustelidae, which also includes badgers, otters, martens, mink and wolverines."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0b97ddbd-4130-4c7a-aa0a-344b85c93064",
                                                "sense_id": "00ff3f9f-16bf-3ed0-a7ce-9b1d9fc699da",
                                                "text": "1998, Vivian Banci, Chapter 5: Wolverine, Thomas E. Kucera, American Marten, Fisher, Lynx, and Wolverine: Survey Methods for Their Detection, Diane Publishing, page 99,\nRelative to smaller mustelids, the wolverine has a robust appearance, rather like a small bear."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "52605ff6-ec57-4fc3-b280-6dc4d2868ded",
                                                "sense_id": "00ff3f9f-16bf-3ed0-a7ce-9b1d9fc699da",
                                                "text": "Mustelid diversity is well reflected in the Neogene fossil record, in spite of the fact that mustelids are among the rarest of fossil carnivores."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2acb0177-0138-4686-9260-a6b0e54bf6fe",
                                                "sense_id": "00ff3f9f-16bf-3ed0-a7ce-9b1d9fc699da",
                                                "text": "The mustelid head has a low, flat skull and short face with small ears and eyes."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
